  "book_code": "EXO",
  "chapter": 38,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "EXO.38.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.38.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made the altar of burnt-offering ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shittim wood: five cubits ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the length of it, and five cubits the breadth of it; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " foursquare; and its hight was three cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.38.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.38.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made its horns on the four corners of it; its horns were of the same: and he overlaid it with brass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.38.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.38.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made all the vessels of the altar, the pots, and the shovels, and the basins, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the flesh-hooks, and the fire-pans: all the vessels of it he made ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " brass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.38.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.38.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made for the altar a brazen grate of net-work under the compass of it beneath to the midst of it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.38.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.38.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he cast four rings for the four ends of the grate of brass, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " places for the staffs.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.38.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.38.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made the staffs ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shittim wood, and overlaid them with brass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.38.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.38.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he put the staffs into the rings on the sides of the altar, to bear it with; he made the altar hollow with boards.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.38.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.38.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made the laver ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " brass, and the foot of it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " brass, of the looking-glasses of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the women",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " assembling, who assembled ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "at",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the door of the tabernacle of the congregation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.38.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.38.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made the court: on the south side southward the hangings of the court ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fine twined linen, a hundred cubits:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
